Package: liboptical-flow-sdk0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: intel-opencl-icd | mesa-opencl-icd
Description: Intel Optical Flow SDK — shared library
 Dense optical flow (DIS / Farneback) and sparse PyrLK for Intel CPU/GPU.
 Backend selection is via the OpticalFlow / SparsePyrLK facade APIs.
 .
 This package contains the runtime shared library (CPU + OpenCL when built).

